<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AcademiaPro | Faculty Recruitment</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,600;8..60,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="/styles.css" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root { --ink:#17212b; --muted:#607080; --paper:#f6f7f5; --line:#d9e1e5; --teal:#0b6b68; --gold:#b47a28; }
body { background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif; }
nav { background:#fff; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); box-shadow:none; padding:1rem max(2rem, calc((100% - 1180px)/2)); }
.logo { color:var(--ink); font-size:1.15rem; letter-spacing:.02em; }
.logo i { color:var(--teal); margin-right:.45rem; }
.nav-links { gap:1.5rem; }
.nav-links span,.nav-links a { color:var(--muted); font-size:.9rem; }
.nav-links span:hover,.nav-links a:hover { color:var(--teal); }
.nav-links .btn { color:#fff; }
.faculty-hero { background:linear-gradient(115deg,#123d48 0%,#176c6b 62%,#d5a24c 150%); color:#fff; padding:5.5rem 2rem 6rem; }
.hero-inner { max-width:1180px; margin:auto; display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.2fr) minmax(280px,.8fr); gap:4rem; align-items:center; }
.eyebrow { color:#f2cb81; font-size:.78rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:1.1rem; }
.faculty-hero h1 { color:#fff; font:700 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.6rem)/1.03 'Source Serif 4',serif; max-width:720px; margin:0 0 1.25rem; }
.faculty-hero p { color:#e4eeee; max-width:650px; font-size:1.08rem; margin-bottom:2rem; }
.hero-actions { display:flex; gap:.8rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
.hero-actions .btn { border-radius:4px; padding:.8rem 1.25rem; }
.hero-actions .btn-primary { background:#d5a24c; color:#17212b; }
.hero-actions .btn-secondary { background:transparent; border-color:#bcd4d4; color:#fff; }
.hero-note { border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35); padding:1.5rem 0 1.5rem 2rem; }
.hero-note strong { display:block; color:#fff; font:600 1.65rem 'Source Serif 4',serif; margin-bottom:.6rem; }
.hero-note span { color:#d2e3e3; font-size:.9rem; }
.section-wrap { max-width:1180px; margin:auto; padding:4rem 2rem; }
.section-heading { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:end; gap:1rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem; }
.section-heading h2 { color:var(--ink); font:700 2.1rem 'Source Serif 4',serif; margin:0; }
.section-heading p { margin:0; max-width:520px; }
.listings { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); gap:1rem; }
.listing { background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-top:3px solid var(--teal); padding:1.35rem; min-height:240px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; }
.listing h3 { font-size:1.08rem; color:var(--ink); margin:.75rem 0 .45rem; }
.listing .institution { color:var(--teal); font-weight:600; }
.listing .meta { color:var(--muted); font-size:.87rem; display:flex; gap:.8rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:.7rem 0; }
.listing .meta i { color:var(--gold); }
.listing .listing-footer { margin-top:auto; padding-top:1rem; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; }
.source { font-size:.75rem; color:var(--muted); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; }
.text-link { color:var(--teal); font-weight:700; font-size:.88rem; }
.text-link i { margin-left:.35rem; }
.portal-band { background:#e8efed; border-top:1px solid #d5e0dd; border-bottom:1px solid #d5e0dd; }
.portals { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:1rem; }
.portal { background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); padding:1.25rem; }
.portal i { color:var(--teal); font-size:1.2rem; margin-bottom:1rem; }
.portal h3 { font-size:1rem; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:.35rem; }
.portal p { font-size:.84rem; margin:0; }
.ai-strip { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem; border-left:4px solid var(--gold); background:#fff; padding:1.2rem 1.4rem; margin-top:2rem; }
.ai-strip i { color:var(--gold); font-size:1.4rem; }
.ai-strip p { margin:0; font-size:.9rem; }
footer { background:#17212b; color:#d9e1e5; padding:2rem max(2rem, calc((100% - 1180px)/2)); margin:0; }
footer p { color:#aab9c1; margin:.25rem 0; }
@media (max-width:700px) { nav { padding:1rem; } .nav-links { gap:.7rem; } .nav-links span:not(.btn) { display:none; } .faculty-hero { padding:4rem 1.25rem; } .hero-inner { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:2rem; } .hero-note { border-left:0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35); padding:1.25rem 0 0; } .section-wrap { padding:3rem 1.25rem; } .section-heading { display:block; } .section-heading h2 { margin-bottom:.5rem; } .portals { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <div class="logo"><i class="fas fa-university"></i> AcademiaPro</div>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <span onclick="window.location.href='/'">Home</span>
    <span onclick="window.location.href='/jobs'">Find positions</span>
    <span onclick="window.location.href='/login'" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin:0;">Sign in</span>
  </div>
</nav>
<header class="faculty-hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Faculty recruitment platform</div>
      <h1>Build the next chapter of your academic career.</h1>
      <p>Discover carefully organized teaching, research, and academic leadership opportunities from universities and trusted job networks.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/jobs"><i class="fas fa-search"></i> Browse faculty positions</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/register"><i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i> Create your profile</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-note"><strong>One profile. More considered opportunities.</strong><span>Keep your academic experience, research interests, and professional links ready for every application.</span></div>
  </div>
</header>
<main>
  <section class="section-wrap">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--teal);margin-bottom:.45rem;">Curated feed</div><h2>Featured academic openings</h2></div><p>Review roles managed in AcademiaPro and follow verified external sources when the opportunity is hosted elsewhere.</p></div>
    <div class="listings">
      <% if (jobs.length) { jobs.slice(0, 3).forEach(job => { %>
        <article class="listing"><div class="institution"><i class="fas fa-building-columns"></i> <%= job.university %></div><h3><%= job.title %></h3><div class="meta"><span><i class="fas fa-location-dot"></i> <%= job.location %></span><span><i class="fas fa-layer-group"></i> <%= job.category %></span></div><div class="listing-footer"><span class="source">AcademiaPro listing</span><a class="text-link" href="/login">View role <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></a></div></article>
      <% }); } else { %><article class="listing"><div class="institution">AcademiaPro</div><h3>New faculty positions are being reviewed.</h3><p>Use the external networks below to explore live academic opportunities today.</p></article><% } %>
      <% universityOpenings.slice(0, 3).forEach(opening => { %>
        <article class="listing"><div class="institution"><i class="fas fa-landmark"></i> <%= opening.university %></div><h3><%= opening.title %></h3><div class="meta"><span><i class="fas fa-location-dot"></i> <%= opening.location %></span><span><i class="fas fa-tag"></i> <%= opening.category %></span></div><div class="listing-footer"><span class="source"><%= opening.source %></span><a class="text-link" href="<%= opening.link %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open source <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i></a></div></article>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-strip"><i class="fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i><p><strong>AI-assisted preparation:</strong> <%= aiEnabled ? 'Your workspace is connected to cloud AI for interview practice and structured feedback.' : 'Interview practice and structured feedback are available when cloud AI is enabled by the administrator.' %></p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="portal-band"><div class="section-wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--teal);margin-bottom:.45rem;">Live job networks</div><h2>Search beyond one institution</h2></div><p>AcademiaPro helps you reach the source. Always review the original posting, closing date, and application requirements before applying.</p></div><div class="portals">
    <a class="portal" href="https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/search/?keywords=faculty" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fab fa-linkedin"></i><h3>LinkedIn</h3><p>Professional networks and university hiring teams.</p></a>
    <a class="portal" href="https://www.naukri.com/teaching-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fas fa-briefcase"></i><h3>Naukri</h3><p>Teaching and higher-education roles across India.</p></a>
    <a class="portal" href="https://in.indeed.com/q-assistant-professor-jobs.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fas fa-globe"></i><h3>Indeed</h3><p>Searchable academic openings and alerts.</p></a>
    <a class="portal" href="/register"><i class="fas fa-user-check"></i><h3>AcademiaPro profile</h3><p>Prepare one structured profile for applications.</p></a>
  </div></div></section>
</main>
<footer><p><strong>AcademiaPro</strong> | Faculty recruitment and academic careers</p><p>Designed by <strong>SURENDAR R S</strong></p><p>External links open the original publisher. Verify each listing before applying.</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
